{"data":[{"author_id":"1080593132482260992","created_at":"2026-10-20T17:49:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112602017894142060"],"id":"2112602017894142060","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":825,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"🇹🇷🇬🇷 土耳其与希腊：过去100年出生人口的惊人变化！\n\n1926年：\n🇹🇷 土耳其约62.5万人\n🇬🇷 希腊约18.1万人\n土耳其是希腊的3.45倍\n\n2025年：\n🇹🇷 土耳其89.5万人\n🇬🇷 希腊6.56万人\n土耳其是希腊的13.65倍！\n\n100年间，两国出生人口差距扩大了近4倍。","url":"https://x.com/Stanley_Liu2018/status/2112602017894142060"},{"author_id":"60042536","created_at":"2026-10-20T01:30:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112355701742018575"],"id":"2112355701742018575","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":353,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112068511380152534","type":"quoted"}],"text":"出生人口腰斩。 https://t.co/yLy69MGxfH","url":"https://x.com/keyemail/status/2112355701742018575"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112784430343573504","3_2112784430372999168"]},"author_id":"1994441421814996992","created_at":"2026-10-21T05:54:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112784449532493937"],"id":"2112784449532493937","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":13,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"这两张图放在一起，看着有点后背发凉。\n\n2016年，内地出生人口1786万，养老金涨幅6.5%。到了2025年，出生人口792万，养老金涨幅只剩2%。\n\n越来越明显的是，领养老金的人越来越多，未来缴费的人却越来越少。\n\n如今，内地年轻人连工作、结婚、生孩子都发愁，养老的账，让他们怎么扛？ https://t.co/HP0objlY4D","url":"https://x.com/Daived_gobain/status/2112784449532493937"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112374913294311424"]},"author_id":"1834541005577572352","created_at":"2026-10-20T02:47:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112375025877795239"],"id":"2112375025877795239","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1733,"like_count":21,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":1},"text":"在不为人知的角落:日韩出生人口增速已经双双转正 https://t.co/FfYy6C5VIJ","url":"https://x.com/losb555/status/2112375025877795